B.Md=s(["A drop-in visit is a short visit. We stop by while you are out. We feed your dog, give a potty break, and play a little.","I don't have a set price for drop-ins yet. DARKULY will tell you the price when he answers your request. You can also email us to ask first.","Pick Drop-in visit on the Request tab, then choose the day and the start and end times."],t.s)
